             26  ************************************************************
             27  *                                                          *
             28  * MENU OF CORTEX COMMANDS (ALPHABETICAL)                   *
             29  *                                                          *
             30  *      ?    WHERE AM I                                     *
             31  *      A    LINE BY LINE ASSEMBLER                         *
             32  *            PC ADDRESS                                    *
             33  *      B    BREAKPOINT SETTING                             *
             34  *            BREAKPOINT NUMBER (CR=DISPLAY ALL BK. PTS.)   *
             35  *            '-' = CLEAR BREAKPOINT LIST                   *
             36  *      C    CRU INSPECT CHANGE                             *
             37  *            BASE ADDRESS                                  *
             38  *            NO. OF BITS                                   *
             39  *      D    TAG DUMP                                       *
             40  *            START ADDRESS                                 *
             41  *            STOP ADDRESS                                  *
             42  *            ENTRY ADDRESS                                 *
             43  *            PROMPT FOR IDT                                *
             44  *      E    EXECUTE - MESSAGES FOLLOW -                    *
             45  *            PC                                            *
             46  *      F    FIND ('CR' =WORD, '-' =BYTE)                   *
             47  *            START ADDRESS                                 *
             48  *            STOP ADDRESS                                  *
             49  *            PATTERN                                       *
             50  *      G    GOTO BASIC  (WARM START)                       *
             51  *      I    INITIALIZE MEMORY                              *
             52  *            START ADDRESS                                 *
             53  *            STOP ADDRESS                                  *
             54  *            VALUE                                         *
             55  *      L    LOADER                                         *
             56  *            PROMPT FOR IDT                                *
             57  *      M    MEMORY INSPECT CHANGE                          *
             58  *            START ADDRESS (CR-MODIFY)                     *
             59  *            STOP ADDRESS                                  *
             60  *      N    NEGATIVE FIND (FIND ANYTHING BUT PATTERN)      *
             61  *            AS 'FIND'                                     *
             62  *      P    OUTPUT PORT TOGGLE                             *
             63  *      R    INSPECT/CHANGE WP,PC, AND ST REGISTERS         *
             64  *             (- GIVES PREVIOUS REGISTER)                  *
             65  *      S    SINGLE/MULTIPLE STEPPING                       *
             66  *            VALUE LESS THAN >80=                          *
             67  *             NO. OF STEPS (NULL OR 0 =1 )                 *
             68  *            VALUE GREATER THAN >80=                       *
             69  *             SINGLE STEP UNTIL MEM ADDR REACHED           *
             70  *      T    TRACE-SINGLE STEP WITH PRINTOUT                *
             71  *            NO. OF STEPS (NULL OR 0 =1 )                  *
             72  *      U    UN-ASSEMBLER                                   *
             73  *            START ADDRESS (CR-SINGLE LINE)                *
             74  *            STOP ADDRESS                                  *
             75  *      W    WORKSPACE REGISTER INSPECT/CHANGE              *
             76  *            REGISTER NUMBER (CR-DUMP ALL REGS.)           *
             77  *      X    TRANSFER (XFER) MEMORY                         *
             78  *            START BYTE ADDRESS                            *
             79  *            STOP  BYTE ADDRESS                            *
             80  *            DESTINATION START BYTE ADDR                   *
             81  *                                                          *
             82  ************************************************************
ASM990 2.4.6     MONITOR                    Sun Jul 20 19:28:48 2025 Page 0004
