            393  ************************************************************
            394  *                                                          *
            395  * INSPECT/CHANGE MEMORY - 'M' COMMAND                      *
            396  *                                                          *
            397  * OPTIONS:                                                 *
            398  *          1) START ADDRESS, CARRIAGE RETURN --            *
            399  *             DISPLAY ADDRESS, CONTENTS, AND               *
            400  *             OPEN THE MEMORY LOCATION FOR A CHANGE.       *
            401  *                                                          *
            402  *          2) CARRIAGE RETURN -- SAME AS 1) BUT THE        *
            403  *             DEFAULT START ADDRESS IS 0000.               *
            404  *                                                          *
            405  *          3) START ADDRESS, BLANK (OR COMMA), STOP        *
            406  *             STOP ADDRESS, CARRIAGE RETURN -- OUTPUT      *
            407  *             MEMORY CONTENTS FROM START ADDRESS TO        *
            408  *             STOP ADDRESS. DEFAULT VALUES FOR BOTH        *
            409  *             ADDRESSES ARE 0000.                          *
            410  *                                                          *
            411  ************************************************************
            412  *
0194 0603   413  M      DEC  R3                1 INPUT?
