LOAD ENTRY POINT, TRACE

            683  *
            684  * LOAD INTERRUPT ENTRY POINT
            685  *
            686  *      POWER UP:      R7=RANDOM VALUE
            687  *      SINGLE STEP:   R7=>9995
            688  *      SS TO ADR:     R7=>9997
            689  *      SS TO VALUE:   R7=>9999
            690  *      TRACE:         R7=>9900
            691  *
030A 0287   692  LOAD   CI   R7,>9997          MEM ADDRESS STEP?
030C 9997 
030E 1605   693         JNE  CHKVAL            NO, JUMP
0310 8380   694         C    R0,R14            REACHED REQUIRED ADDRESS?
0312 16EC   695  CHKDUN JNE  STEP              DONE?
0314        696  PRTSTP MSG  @STPMSG           GO PRINT DATA
