0320 8050   700         C    *R0,R1            CHECK IF ADR=VAL
0322 10F7   701         JMP  CHKDUN            GO FIX IT
0324 0287   702  CHKSGL CI   R7,>9995          SINGLE STEP?
0326 9995 
     0326'  703  INITIZ EQU  $-2
0328 13E3   704         JEQ  STPCHK
032A 0287   705         CI   R7,>9900          TRACE STEP?
032C 9900 
