           1628  *
           1629  * SUBROUTINE WHICH PRINTS THE MNEMONIC BASED ON
           1630  *      THE TABLE OFFSET COMPUTED IN REG 1
           1631  *
0906 0203  1632  PRTOP  LI   R3,4              LOAD CHAR COUNT
0908 0004 
090A D0B1  1633  PRT1   MOVB *R1+,R2           GET CHARACTER FROM TABLE
090C       1634         WRIT R2                PRINT CHARACTER
090E 0603  1635         DEC  R3                DECREMENT COUNT
0910 16FC  1636         JNE  PRT1              REPEAT FOR FOUR CHAR
0912       1637         WRIT R6                PRINT SPACE
0914 06C6  1638         SWPB R6                ASCII ',' IN UPPER BYTE
